{
  "$schema": "../gen/schemas/desktop-schema.json",
  "identifier": "main-window",
  "description": "Local profile editing, in-memory import of official .mhz profiles as dry-run-only profiles, device-free replay, and read-only device input feeds, supervised masterhub-service action runs with sleep/wake and reconnect sessions, local diagnostic bundles, opt-in focused-app profile rules, offline display artwork preparation, the opt-in experimental module display setting, and the opt-in loopback OBS WebSocket setting (endpoint stored, password held in memory only) in the main window.",
